    "text": "By Eyewitness News ,\n1 hours ago\nIt was a very special night on Wednesday for an important organization making a difference in the Tri-State area.\nEyewitness News' Sam Champion emceed the New York Edge Gala in Midtown.\nHe wasn't alone. Other members of the Eyewitness News team were there to show their support.\nThe organization's mission is to help bridge the gap between students in under-invested communities by providing a wide variety of programs and skills.",
